      "children": [
        {
          "id": "e47f118c-b5c4-4b48-86c4-a77fb8de1d11",
          "text": "中心概念：滤子",
          "children": [
            {
              "id": "d434b857-8199-4c74-91f2-8b745f91e914",
              "text": "[目标] Filter.coext",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "e47f118c-b5c4-4b48-86c4-a77fb8de1d11",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 目标\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Basic`\n\n**角色** 目标定理\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {f g : Filter α}, (∀ (s : Set α), sᶜ ∈ f ↔ sᶜ ∈ g) → f = g\n```\n\n**文档**\nAn extensionality lemma that is useful for filters with good lemmas about `sᶜ ∈ f` (e.g.,\n`Filter.comap`, `Filter.coprod`, `Filter.Coprod`, `Filter.cofinite`).",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "目标",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#2563eb",
                "color": "#ffffff",
                "fontWeight": "bold",
                "shape": "round",
                "borderColor": "#1e40af",
                "borderWidth": 2
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "932400fa-2d56-47b5-85ae-2cbe25c5ba80",
              "text": "[陈述] Filter",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "e47f118c-b5c4-4b48-86c4-a77fb8de1d11",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 陈述\n\n**类型** inductive\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\nType u_1 → Type u_1\n```\n\n**文档**\nA filter `F` on a type `α` is a collection of sets of `α` which contains the whole `α`,\nis upwards-closed, and is stable under intersection. We do not forbid this collection to be\nall sets of `α`.",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "陈述",
                  "inductive"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f8fbff",
                "color": "#1e3a8a",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#93c5fd"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "de9692ec-d921-46ff-9c1d-0d01b5dbd296",
              "text": "[证明] Filter.ext",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "e47f118c-b5c4-4b48-86c4-a77fb8de1d11",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} {f g : Filter α}, (∀ (s : Set α), s ∈ f ↔ s ∈ g) → f = g\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
                  "theorem"
                ]
              },
              "style": {
                "background": "#f7fef9",
                "color": "#14532d",
                "fontSize": 13,
                "borderColor": "#86efac"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "fab22bbc-6f11-4ee3-ad28-0967dbd70b9b",
              "text": "[证明] Filter.filter_eq",
              "children": [],
              "isExpanded": true,
              "parentId": "e47f118c-b5c4-4b48-86c4-a77fb8de1d11",
              "data": {
                "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** theorem\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u_1} {f g : Filter α}, f.sets = g.sets → f = g\n```\n\n**文档**\n（无 docstring）",
                "tags": [
                  "declaration",
                  "证明",
