                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "e9b8d4b7-9a8b-464c-a762-eb3dc71b4a27",
                  "text": "[证明] Set.ofPred",
                  "children": [],
                  "isExpanded": true,
                  "parentId": "835635e2-e6e7-4288-888b-b465427aaa5c",
                  "data": {
                    "note": "**层** 证明\n\n**类型** definition\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Data.Set.Defs`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n{α : Type u} → (α → Prop) → Set α\n```\n\n**文档**\nTurn a predicate `p : α → Prop` into a set, also written as `{x | p x}`",
