      "isExpanded": true,
      "data": {
        "note": "**目标** `Filter.coext`\n\n**模块** `Mathlib.Order.Filter.Basic`\n\n**签名**\n```lean\n∀ {α : Type u} {f g : Filter α}, (∀ (s : Set α), sᶜ ∈ f ↔ sᶜ ∈ g) → f = g\n```\n\n**文档**\nAn extensionality lemma that is useful for filters with good lemmas about `sᶜ ∈ f` (e.g.,\n`Filter.comap`, `Filter.coprod`, `Filter.Coprod`, `Filter.cofinite`).\n\n**聚焦** 半径 2；全闭包 1327 节点，本图显示 50 个，深层 1277 个未展开\n\n**读图** `[陈述]` 是理解命题所需，`[证明]` 是证明层新增，`[实例]`/`[内部]` 默认折叠。概念之间的真实依赖写在概念节点备注里。\n\n**来源** `experiments/mathlib-spike` 生成；树是概念投影，不是原始依赖图。",
        "tags": [
